The driver provides support for video class devices.  A video de‐
vice  consists  of  a number of components.  Every device has one
control interface.  Each device optionally provides streaming in‐
terfaces (input or output).  Does not support all  of  UVC  spec.
Only  supports  the one streaming input interface.  Does not sup‐
port the interrupt  endpoint  for  some  controls.   Exports  the
Video4Linux2 API via and V4L2 lacks support for some UVC features
such as still images.
